name arydshln
category Package
revision 50084
shortdesc Draw dash-lines in array/tabular
relocated 1
longdesc The package is to draw dash-lines in array/tabular
longdesc environments. Horizontal lines are drawn by \hdashline and
longdesc \cdashline while vertical ones can be specified as a part of
longdesc the preamble using ':'. The shape of dash-lines may be
longdesc controlled through style parameters or optional arguments. The
longdesc package is compatible with array, colortab, longtable, and
longdesc colortbl.
runfiles size=12
